7. KA POR

8. U PAILA JINGSTAD

Ka shalyntem ka por ka laimareh,

Ka sngl mynta ka leit, iashai kan wan;

Ki kam batrei baroh, hap leh branbran, 
Ryngkat ryngkat bad ka ngin hap banbeh;

Banieid la ka, bansumar bad hiewkor,

Ym kum u jaipdeh u bathait bantrei; 
Banshong aihia bad ban pynbijai ei,

Hynrei ngin lum ki mawlynnai kordor;

Ha sh'wa ba ka sngi kan sep sha lyndet, 
Ngin puh, ngin dam, ngm trei, ngin ym shongthait; 
Ngin ym ai lad la ka jingthait jinglwait, 
Ngin trei shitom 'la ki kti ngin pynstet;
